<title>SRI LANKA: Horana up 4.35 pct on growth prospects.</title>
<headline>Horana up 4.35 pct on growth prospects.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Horana Plantations Ltd rose 4.35 percent or one rupee to 24 in early Wednesday trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Plantations saw good growth in 1995 and 1996 due to good demand for tea. The sector is expected to do well in 1997 also,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>Horana Plantations is one of six privatised estate firms trading in Colombo.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
